              "term": "virya",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " (potent energy) of a substance, which is either Ushna (warming) or Shīta (cooling). From here, the sour taste is yielded into "
            },
            {
              "t": "Rasa Dhātu",
              "term": "rasa dhatu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " (plasma). The location of the sour taste is on the anterior outer sides of the "
            },
