              "t": "gallbladder",
              "term": "gallbladder",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ". "
            },
            {
              "t": "Samāna Vāyu",
              "term": "samana vayu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " facilitates the linear movement that pushes the "
