              "t": "chyme",
              "term": "chyme",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " forward and regulates the water-electrolyte balance. From here, the salty taste is yielded into "
            },
            {
              "t": "Rasa Dhātu",
              "term": "rasa dhatu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " (plasma). The inner surface of the entire "
