              "term": "samana vayu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": ". During this hour, the predominant intestinal "
            },
            {
              "t": "enzymes",
              "term": "enzymes",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " exhibit pungent properties, facilitating the ongoing chemical breakdown of macronutrients, including proteins, fats, and carbohydrates. The fire element inherent to this stage enhances "
            },
            {
              "t": "thermogenesis",
              "term": "thermogenesis",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " and increases blood circulation within the "
            },
            {
              "t": "GI tract",
              "term": "gi tract",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ", promoting optimal enzymatic activity and turning the "
            },
            {
              "t": "chyme",
              "term": "chyme",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " yellowish-brown. Simultaneously, the air element produces gases and stimulates intestinal "
            },
            {
              "t": "peristalsis",
              "term": "peristalsis",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " via "
            },
            {
              "t": "Samāna Vāyu",
              "term": "samana vayu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": ", which is essential for the effective "
            },
            {
              "t": "propulsion",
              "term": "propulsion",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " of digestive contents. While most "
            },
            {
              "t": "absorption",
              "term": "absorption",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " occurs in the "
            },
            {
              "t": "ileum",
              "term": "ileum",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": " and "
            },
            {
