              "term": "chyme",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": " through the intestinal "
            },
            {
              "t": "villi",
              "term": "villi",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ". This stage exerts a systemic cooling effect on the body, helping to alleviate symptoms associated with elevated "
            },
            {
              "t": "Pitta Dosha",
              "term": "pitta dosha",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": ". From here, the bitter taste is yielded into "
