              "term": "transverse colon",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ", "
            },
            {
              "t": "splenic flexure",
              "term": "splenic flexure",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ", and "
            },
            {
              "t": "descending colon",
              "term": "descending colon",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ". During this phase, the remaining water, minerals, and electrolytes are absorbed into the system. The earth element provides the roughness and bulk necessary to compact waste material into well-bound feces ("
            },
            {
              "t": "Purīsha",
              "term": "purisha",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": ") in the "
            },
            {
              "t": "descending colon",
              "term": "descending colon",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": " and "
            },
            {
              "t": "sigmoid colon",
              "term": "sigmoid colon",
              "cat": "anatomy"
            },
            {
              "t": ". This stage stimulates mass "
            },
            {
              "t": "peristalsis",
              "term": "peristalsis",
              "cat": "physiology"
            },
            {
              "t": ", and the air element nourishes "
            },
            {
              "t": "Poshaka Vata",
              "term": "poshaka vata",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " to facilitate the urge to defecate. The process culminates as the downward and outward energy of "
            },
            {
