    {
      "kicker": "Chapter Three",
      "title": "Vāta — the principle of movement",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "segments": [
            {
              "t": "Vāta Dosha",
              "term": "vata dosha",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " is the Ayurvedic principle of mobility that regulates all activity in the body and mind, from the flow of thoughts to the movement of food through the intestines. It governs all biological movement and carries the other two Doshas throughout the body. It is primarily composed of the "
            },
            {
              "t": "Ākāsha",
              "term": "akasha",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " (ether) and "
            },
            {
              "t": "Vāyu",
              "term": "vayu",
              "cat": "ayurveda"
            },
            {
              "t": " (air) elements."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Vāta’s Gunas:",
          "level": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "t": "Rūksha dry: leading to dry skin, hair, lips, "
              },
              {
                "t": "tongue",
                "term": "tongue",
                "cat": "anatomy"
              },
              {
                "t": ", "
              },
              {
                "t": "colon",
                "term": "colon",
                "cat": "anatomy"
              },
              {
                "t": ", tending toward constipation and a hoarse voice"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Laghu light: light muscles, bones, thin body frame, light sleep and being underweight"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Shīta cold: resulting in cold hands and feet, poor circulation,  dislike for cold environments prefers hot, tending toward stiffness of muscles"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Khāra rough: characterized by rough, cracked skin, nails, hair, teeth, hands and feet, and cracking joints"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Sūkshma subtle: associated with subtle fear, anxiety, insecurity, goose-bumps, muscle twitching, and fine tremors"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Chala mobile: leading to fast walking and talking, doing many things at a time, restless eyes, hands, and feet, unstable joints, many dreams, loves travelling and does not stay at one place, swinging moods, shaky faith, scattered mind"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "Vishada clear: clairvoyant; understands immediately and forgets immediately; clear, empty mind, experiences void and loneliness"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h",
          "text": "Vāta’s physical appearance, Ākruti is typically:",
          "level": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "t": "body frame: thin, slender, often disproportionate; very tall or very short, with visible bones and prominent veins"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "weight: generally low or underweight, with difficulty gaining weight"
              }
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "t": "nose: often thin, crooked, or uneven, may have a deviated septum"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "eyes: small, sunken, dry, and active, the gaze is unsteady or darting,  iris is dark, gray, or brown"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "lips: thin, dry, and cracked, often with a brownish color tinge"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "teeth: long, protruding, or irregular, with gaps between them, big thin gums"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "skin: thin, dry, cold, and rough to the touch,  tends to a darker complexion and tans easily"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "t": "hair: dry, brittle, curly or kinky; thin or scarce and prone to split ends and dandruff"
              }
            ],
            [
              {
